OL,3,GNEWSACruise ship numbers still low amid
OL,4,Avisitor rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of cruise ships visiting
OL,7,FGuernsey is still low compared to
OL,8,Fpre-pandemic figures, a coach company
OL,9,Fboss has said.
OL,11,FHannah Beacom, managing director of
OL,12,FIsland Coachway, said cruises would be
OL,13,Fbooked 100 days of the year, and booked
OL,14,Fup to two years in advance, but now
OL,15,Fthey were looking at between 40 to 50 a
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,F"It makes a difference to how you plan
OL,19,Fyour season and prioritise resources,"
OL,20,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
