OL,3,GNEWSACruise ship numbers still low amid
OL,4,Avisitor rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest quarterly travel and visitor
OL,7,Faccommodation bulletin said visitor
OL,8,Fnumbers, excluding yacht and cruise
OL,9,Fship passengers, have risen to 81,681,
OL,10,Fwhich was not far below pre-pandemic
OL,11,Flevels.
